  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Aktiviteten saknar beskrivning. Kontakta Sida f&#xf6;r mer information. Ring +46 8 698 50 00 eller skicka e-post till sida@sida.se.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Swedish support to HIV and Aids activities in Niassa started in 2001 with support to NGO working with HIV-prevention. A new agreement was signed in 2006 with the ojectives to raise awareness and improve the care of people living with HIV and Aids. Organisations supported are: Concern Universal and Estamos.</narrative>
